---
description: Ember Line multi-agent lane rules
globs: ["**/*.ts", "**/*.tsx", "**/*.json"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Read AGENTS.md at the repo root before any code change.

Quick rules:
- Either lane may update packages/domain for its feature; follow the shared-contract rules in AGENTS.md.
- Never push to main or the other lane's branch.
- Keep CI green (typecheck + lint + test) before merging to your lane branch.
- Use Zod from @ember/domain to validate all cross-boundary data.
- Distinguish simTimeMs from wallElapsedMs everywhere - they are different branded types.
- Private world parameters must never appear in coordinator projections or WebSocket messages.
